{"id":"volk","lemma":"Volk","pos":"noun","rank":892,"glosses":["people, nation, folk, tribe, race (group united by culture, history, descent, and/or language)","people, population, citizens","folk, crowd (large group of people gathered somewhere)"],"ipa":"/fɔlk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bf/De-Volk.ogg/De-Volk.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Volkes","plural":"Völker"},"formAudio":{"Volkes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7f/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Volkes.wav","Völker":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-V%C3%B6lker.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich muss diesem Volk helfen.","en":"I must help these people.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Er war immer auf der Seite des Volkes.","en":"He was always on the people's side.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"at all times without…"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"side"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Das Volk liebt die Freiheit.","en":"People love freedom.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to love","l":"lieben"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"freedom"}]},{"text":"Sie sind ein friedvolles Volk.","en":"They are a peace-loving people.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null,null]},{"text":"Das Opium des Volkes ist die Religion.","en":"Religion is the opium of the people.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/42445","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"opium"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"religion"}]}]}